Package: ORMetrics
Title: Transparent Open Science Indicators for Responsible Research Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Computes open science indicators for a researcher from the
    evidence held by 'OpenAlex' <https://openalex.org/>, 'DataCite'
    <https://datacite.org/> and the 'OpenAIRE' Graph
    <https://graph.openaire.eu/>: open access share, repository copies,
    shared datasets and software, reuse of shared outputs, preprints and
    study registrations. Each indicator is reported on its own, with its
    definition, its evidence, the sources consulted and its limitations;
    there is no composite score. An indicator that cannot be verified from
    the sources is reported as unverifiable, never as zero. Definitions
    come from a versioned catalogue shared with the web tool, and every
    definition is bound to the code of its exact methodology version.
